Enterprise-Grade Sales Analytics and Business Intelligence Platform
ROLE AND EXPECTATIONS

Act as a Staff Software Engineer, Senior Full-Stack Developer, Software Architect, Data Analyst, Database Engineer, Cybersecurity Engineer, and UI/UX Designer.

Design and implement SalesInsight, a professional, secure, scalable, data-driven sales analytics and business intelligence platform.

Do not produce a simple demonstration, static dashboard, or collection of disconnected pages. Build a functional software system with a real database, working authentication, backend APIs, a Python analytics engine, business reporting services, data visualization, and administrator controls.

