1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Project name: SalesInsight

Application type: Web-based sales analytics and business intelligence platform.

Primary purpose: Enable individuals, retailers, small businesses, and organizations to upload sales data, clean and analyze it, discover business trends, visualize performance, and generate actionable reports.

Problem Statement

Many businesses collect sales data but lack the technical skills and tools needed to turn that data into useful business information. Sales records may be scattered across spreadsheets, contain errors, and provide little insight into revenue, profitability, product performance, customer purchasing behavior, or regional trends.

Proposed Solution

SalesInsight will provide a centralized platform where authenticated users can upload sales datasets, validate and clean their data, run analytical processes, explore interactive dashboards, compare business performance, and export reports.

The platform will combine Python-based data analysis, a relational database, secure APIs, interactive frontend visualizations, and optional Power BI integration.

Main Objectives
Develop a secure platform for user registration, account management, and sales dataset management.
Implement reliable sales data processing, analysis, visualization, and reporting using Python, PostgreSQL, Node.js, and C#.
Provide role-based administration, business insights, data protection, and a professional user experience.
